# The gate lives in `npm run fallow:ci`, NOT in `npx fallow`: the raw report
# exits 1 on pre-existing debt (6 dead-code issues, 20 clone groups) and would
# block every commit in a correctly installed worktree, which is how every other
# gate gets bypassed with --no-verify. Do not "simplify" this back to npx fallow.
npm run fallow:ci
npx tsc --noEmit
